.TH FCHOWN 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fchown \- change ownership of an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int fchown(int descriptor, uid_t owner, gid_t group);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes ownership of the open file.  Either ID may be \-1, converted to its
respective unsigned type, to leave that ID unchanged.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chown (3crunch),
.BR fchown (2)
